---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="System Upgrade"
  description="Empowering educators with innovative tools and resources to redefine learning and create impactful, future-ready education for a changing world."
>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       HERO
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="hero" aria-label="System Upgrade">
    <img
      class="hero__bg"
      src="/images/2021/04/20181027_115108-scaled.jpg"
      alt="Educators working in a makerspace setting"
    />
    <div class="container hero__content">
      <h1>System Upgrade</h1>
      <p class="hero__tagline">
        Empowering educators with innovative tools and resources to redefine learning
        and create impactful, future-ready education for a changing world.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       INTRO
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section" aria-label="About System Upgrade">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Redefining Education</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <p class="intro-text">
        The System Upgrade initiative equips educators with tools and resources to
        revolutionize education, disrupt outdated standards, and deliver impactful,
        relevant content across diverse fields.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       SFUSD PARTNERSHIP
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--alt" aria-label="SFUSD partnership">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>SteamHead &amp; the SFUSD</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <div class="two-col mt-md">
        <div>
          <p>
            We are thrilled to announce the launch of exciting new STEAM programs at
            Ulloa and Sunset Elementary Schools.
          </p>
          <p>
            This development underscores our dedication to tailoring our educational
            initiatives to meet the specific needs of each community. We believe that
            by introducing these STEAM programs, we can contribute significantly to the
            academic growth and development of students — providing them with enriching
            and innovative learning experiences.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our commitment extends beyond mere program implementation, aiming to make
            a positive impact on the unique educational landscape of each school,
            fostering a supportive and engaging environment for students to thrive.
          </p>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/2024/05/microbit-flashing-heart.png"
          alt="micro:bit electronics project"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       PRODUCTIONS
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section" aria-label="SteamHead Productions">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-col two-col--reverse">
        <img
          src="/images/2021/08/GettingStartedWithMFEDU.png"
          alt="SteamHead Productions video resource"
        />
        <div>
          <h2>SteamHead Productions</h2>
          <hr class="accent-rule" />
          <p>
            We launched SteamHead Productions with the aim of capturing and disseminating
            the stories of our students, alongside sharing our accumulated knowledge
            with educators worldwide.
          </p>
          <p>
            Collaborating with the nonprofit organization Cultivative and our media
            director Mike Shaw, we transformed this initiative into a comprehensive
            platform. Our goal was to showcase our students in a professional manner
            and to spark inspiration among a broad audience.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       ONLINE COURSE
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--dark" aria-label="MakeFashion Edu Online Course">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <h2>MakeFashion Edu Online Course</h2>
          <hr class="accent-rule" />
          <p>
            Empowering students to design their future, one stitch at a time.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our MakeFashion Edu Online Course brings the intersection of technology and
            self-expression into classrooms worldwide. Through engaging modules, students
            learn design thinking, electronics, and fashion tech — transforming ideas
            into wearable creations.
          </p>
          <p>
            This course isn't just about fashion — it's about giving students the tools
            to tell their stories and build their confidence through innovation.
          </p>
          <a href="/shop/" class="btn btn--primary mt-md">Explore the Course</a>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/2023/09/1.png"
          alt="MakeFashion Edu online course"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       MAKERSPACE BADGES
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--alt" aria-label="Makerspace Badges">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-col">
        <img
          src="/images/2024/05/badges_sm.png"
          alt="SteamHead Makerspace Badges"
        />
        <div>
          <h2>Makerspace Badges</h2>
          <hr class="accent-rule" />
          <p>
            Building skills, earning achievements, and creating futures.
          </p>
          <p>
            The Makerspace Badges give teachers a pathway to guide students through
            meaningful makerspace experiences. Not "how to 3D print" — but <em>why</em>
            and <em>for who</em>, basing learning on empathy and authentic problem solving.
          </p>
          <p>
            Each badge represents a step forward in mastery — whether it's soldering
            circuits, 3D printing, interviewing clients, or sketching ideas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       SHTEAM LABS ACTIVITIES
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section" aria-label="SHTEAM Labs Activities">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>SHTEAM Labs Activities</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <p class="mt-md">
        Documenting our journey, one lesson at a time.
      </p>
      <p>
        The SHTEAM Labs Activities Journals are our latest collection of lesson plans,
        student reflections, and activity guides. They are custom-tailored resources
        designed for particular classrooms — and you might find that they suit your
        classroom as well.
      </p>
      <a href="/shop/" class="btn btn--primary mt-md">Browse SHTEAM Labs Resources</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       JOIN THE COMMUNITY
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--dark" aria-label="Join the community">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Join the Conversation</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <p class="mt-md">
        Educators, did you know that Hackers are lifelong learners contributing educational
        content to their communities? Hackers, did you know teachers from Kindergarten
        through University are advocating for the skills and values in your makerspaces
        to be brought into schools?
      </p>
      <p>
        Join us online to discuss and support each other. No experience required — all
        levels of Educators and Hackers welcome.
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.steamhead.space/contact-us/" class="btn btn--outline mt-md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Get Involved
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro-text {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    max-width: 60ch;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
